{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/issues/134","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/issues/134/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/issues/134/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/issues/134/events","html_url":"https://github.com/less/less.js/issues/134","id":394017,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUzOTQwMTc=","number":134,"title":"@import directive in an already @import'd file uses full url with hash as base","user":{"login":"dbergey","id":14341,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzQx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14341?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbergey","html_url":"https://github.com/dbergey","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbergey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbergey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbergey/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbergey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbergey/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbergey/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbergey/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbergey/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbergey/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":2102758,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMTAyNzU4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/labels/browser","name":"browser","color":"e102d8","default":false,"description":null},{"id":2103265,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMTAzMjY1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"e10c02","default":true,"description":null},{"id":9603654,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NjAzNjU0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/labels/medium%20priority","name":"medium priority","color":"0000E0","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2010-11-01T18:23:05Z","updated_at":"2012-08-12T12:14:31Z","closed_at":"2012-08-12T12:14:31Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"My page's url looks like this, with a hash in the middle: http://mysite.com/#/controller/function/\n\nIn a &lt;style&gt; tag on the main page, I have (which works fine):\n\n```\n@import \"/assets/main.less\";\n```\n\nInside main.less is another @import without a path:\n\n```\n@import \"include.less\"\n```\n\nThe browser requests it as \"http://mysite.com/#/controller/function/include.less\", disregarding the hash. I have discovered that if I comment out the block:\n\n```\n// Stylesheets in IE don't always return the full path\nif (! /^(https?|file):/.test(href)) {\n    href = url.slice(0, url.lastIndexOf('/') + 1) + href;\n}\n```\n\n...it works, and I have worked around it for now in Safari by adding a second condition thusly:\n\n```\n// Stylesheets in IE don't always return the full path\nif (! /^(https?|file):/.test(href) && /msie/.test(navigator.userAgent)) {\n    href = url.slice(0, url.lastIndexOf('/') + 1) + href;\n}\n```\n\n...but that is of course not a good long-term solution, and probably doesn't fix the issue in IE.\n\nBeing unfamiliar with the less.js codebase, I'm not sure what or where the problem is. Help?\n","closed_by":{"login":"lukeapage","id":309321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwOTMyMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/309321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukeapage","html_url":"https://github.com/lukeapage","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukeapage/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users